- [ ] Only the tests marked as failing were repaired
- [ ] `testCommand` was run after each round of fixes
- [ ] Iteration continued until the command output confirmed 100% of tests passing
- [ ] If any test remained unresolved after several attempts, an explicit note was left explaining why

**Proactive Workflow**
