- [ ] `package.json` test script was identified
- [ ] `Tasks to do List` was generated and shown to the user
- [ ] All tasks were completed in a single continuous loop, without stopping for confirmation
- [ ] 90%+ coverage was verified on all modified files
- [ ] Final completion summary with coverage stats was reported
